    "detailed_description": "Kingdom's Architect is an immersive tower defense game where you must defend an entire kingdom from relentless enemy attacks. As you fend off waves of foes, you'll earn experience points that allow you to upgrade your defenses and strengthen your strategic capabilities.<br><br>Visit the in-game shop to enhance your arsenal with powerful new upgrades and equipment. Along your journey, you'll encounter unique characters who will require your assistance, adding depth to your adventure.<br><br>Prepare to face an unknown evil that threatens the realm. Do you have what it takes to defend the kingdom and emerge victorious?<br><br>Key Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic Defense Building: Construct and upgrade various types of defensive structures, such as cannons, walls, and traps, to create an impenetrable defense.<br></li><li>Diverse Enemies: Face a variety of enemies, each with unique abilities and strengths, requiring different strategies to defeat.<br></li><li>Epic Boss Battles: Prepare to face formidable bosses with challenging mechanics and tactics, testing your strategic skills.<br></li><li>Drag and drop system to create the perfect defense.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134880/extras/7012411c2b2733c45f400b3ff476c5a3.avif?t=1734348342\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>",
